    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are matching freelance projects to one specific freelancer.\n\nFREELANCER PROFILE:\n{{ $('Extract Skill Profile').first().json.text }}\n\nPROJECTS TO SCORE (JSON array):\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.jobs.map(j => ({url: j.url, title: j.title, skills: j.skills, budget_usd_max: j.budget_usd_max}))) }}\n\nFor EVERY project in the array, score from 0 to 100 how well it fits this freelancer, and give one short sentence of reasoning.\n\nScoring rules:\n- 80-100: squarely in their core skills\n- 50-79: adjacent, they could do it with some stretch\n- 20-49: weak overlap\n- 0-19: wrong field entirely\nBe honest and be willing to give low scores. A project needing skills this freelancer does not have MUST score below 20. Do not credit them with skills absent from the profile.\n\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON array, no markdown fences, one object per project:\n[{\"url\": \"...\", \"title\": \"...\", \"score\": 0, \"reason\": \"...\"}]"
      },
      "id": "b191ce0e-2079-4fa1-b41c-93d69f1c8929",
      "name": "Score Jobs vs Profile",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.6,
      "position": [
        -576,
        -544
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "maxTokens": 8192
        }
      },
      "id": "b60f2572-9a9d-4288-aa70-a51889f40442",
      "name": "OpenRouter Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenRouter",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -576,
        -320
      ],
